27:17','2020-12-30 09:27:17','[vc_row bg_type=\"grad\" bg_override=\"ex-full\" type=\"vc_default\" css=\".vc_custom_1457088446751{margin-top: -120px !important;}\" bg_grad=\"background: -webkit-gradient(linear, left top, left bottom, color-stop(0%, #10192A), color-stop(99%, #070A10));background: -moz-linear-gradient(top,#10192A 0%,#070A10 99%);background: -webkit-linear-gradient(top,#10192A 0%,#070A10 99%);background: -o-linear-gradient(top,#10192A 0%,#070A10 99%);background: -ms-linear-gradient(top,#10192A 0%,#070A10 99%);background: linear-gradient(top,#10192A 0%,#070A10 99%);\"][vc_column][rev_slider slidertitle=\"pisos-eva-deck-lanchas\" alias=\"pisos-eva-deck-embarcaciones\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row equal_height=\"yes\" content_placement=\"middle\" bg_type=\"bg_color\" bg_override=\"ex-full\" type=\"vc_default\" css=\".vc_custom_1456939980365{background-color: #ffffff !important;}\" bg_color_value=\"#ffffff\" el_id=\"features\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1456743683783{padding-top: 60px !important;padding-bottom: 60px !important;}\" offset=\"vc_col-lg-offset-0 vc_col-lg-5 vc_col-md-offset-0 vc_col-md-6\"][vc_column_text]\n<h1>Piso Antideslizante Goma Eva para Lanchas</h1>\n[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=\"30px\"][vc_column_text]Los pisos antideslizante EVADECK están fabricadas de EVA con celdas cerradas de la más alta calidad.\n\nNuestro antiderrapante es excepcional incluso cuando está mojada, comodidad incomparable al estar de pie, absorción de choque, que disminuye la fatiga, protección de las superficies y reducción de ruido – ideal para los pescadores, fácil de limpiar y resistente a las manchas, entre otros.[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=\"20px\"][dt_button link=\"#!/apps\" size=\"medium\" style=\"link\" text_color_style=\"accent\" text_hover_color_style=\"context\" icon=\"JTNDaSUyMGNsYXNzJTNEJTIyZmElMjBmYS1hbmdsZS1yaWdodCUyMiUzRSUzQyUyRmklM0U=\" icon_align=\"right\" smooth_scroll=\"true\"]Explore Apps[/dt_button][/vc_column][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1456604074007{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-right: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;margin-left: 0px !important;border-top-width: 0px !important;border-right-width: 0px !important;border-bottom-width: 0px !important;border-left-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\" offset=\"vc_col-lg-offset-1 vc_col-lg-6 vc_col-md-offset-0 vc_col-md-6 vc_hidden-sm vc_hidden-xs\"][vc_single_image image=\"862\" img_size=\"559 × 642\" css=\".vc_custom_1609320413067{margin-top: 12% !important;margin-bottom: -5% !important;padding-left: 50px !important;}\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content\" equal_height=\"yes\" content_placement=\"middle\" ult_hide_row=\"ult_hide_row_value\" ult_hide_row_tablet=\"tablet\" ult_hide_row_tablet_small=\"xs_tablet\" ult_hide_row_mobile=\"mobile\" ult_hide_row_mobile_large=\"xl_mobile\" type=\"vc_default\" css=\".vc_custom_1456743056656{padding-right: 60px !important;padding-left: 60px !important;}\" el_class=\"hide-mobile-paddings\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1456670646180{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-right: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;margin-left: 0px !important;border-top-width: 0px !important;border-right-width: 0px !important;border-bottom-width: 0px !important;border-left-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;background-color: #f5f5f5 !important;}\" offset=\"vc_col-lg-6 vc_col-md-6\"][ultimate_carousel slides_on_desk=\"1\" slides_on_tabs=\"1\" slides_on_mob=\"1\" speed=\"600\" autoplay=\"off\" arrow_size=\"28\" next_icon=\"ultsl-arrow-right6\" prev_icon=\"ultsl-arrow-left6\" css_ad_caraousel=\".vc_custom_1457102400244{margin-top: 8% !important;margin-bottom: 8% !important;padding-right: 10% !important;padding-left: 10% !important;}\"][ult_content_box][vc_single_image image=\"814\" img_size=\"360 × 400\" alignment=\"center\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1456742177154{padding-top: 30px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}\" el_class=\"product-small-text\"]\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Advanced Fitness Tracker</p>\n[/vc_column_text][/ult_content_box][ult_content_box][vc_single_image image=\"815\" img_size=\"360 × 400\" alignment=\"center\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1456737024957{padding-top: 30px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}\" el_class=\"product-small-text\"]\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Alarm &amp; Reminders</p>\n[/vc_column_text][/ult_content_box][ult_content_box][vc_single_image image=\"816\" img_size=\"360 × 400\" alignment=\"center\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1456742505915{padding-top: 30px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}\" el_class=\"product-small-text\"]\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Compact Media Player</p>\n[/vc_column_text][/ult_content_box][/ultimate_carousel][/vc_column][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1456670657896{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-right: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;margin-left: 0px !important;border-top-width: 0px !important;border-right-width: 0px !important;border-bottom-width: 0px !important;border-left-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 40px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 60px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\" offset=\"vc_col-lg-offset-1 vc_col-lg-4 vc_col-md-offset-1 vc_col-md-5 vc_col-sm-offset-0\"][vc_column_text]\n<h2>Formas de Adherencia</h2>\n[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=\"30px\"][vc_column_text]\n<div>\n<div>\n<h5>– Adhesivo de alta adherencia a base de acrílico 3M ™, la cual viene con una película de transferencia que al retirarla queda lista para ser adherida en cualquier superficie.</h5>\n<h5>– Fasnap que le ofrece un sistema de colocación de las plantillas a base de broches altamente resistentes a la oxidación los cuales permiten que las plantillas sean removidas en cualquier momento.</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--more-->\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<p class=\"font_8\"></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content\" equal_height=\"yes\" content_placement=\"middle\" type=\"vc_default\" css=\".vc_custom_1456743439328{padding-right: 60px !important;padding-left: 60px !important;}\" el_class=\"hide-mobile-paddings\"][vc_column offset=\"vc_hidden-lg vc_hidden-md\" css=\".vc_custom_1456479553715{margin: 0px !important;border-width: 0px !important;padding: 0px !important;background-color: #f5f5f5 !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"811\" img_size=\"500x500\" alignment=\"center\"][/vc_column][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1456668300567{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-right: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;margin-left: 0px !important;border-top-width: 0px !important;border-right-width: 0px !important;border-bottom-width: 0px !important;border-left-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 40px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 60px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\" offset=\"vc_col-lg-offset-1 vc_col-lg-4 vc_col-md-offset-0 vc_col-md-5 vc_col-sm-offset-0\"][vc_column_text]\n<h2>Características Principales</h2>\n– Fácil instalación con 3M PSA (adhesivo sensible a la presión).\n– Protección UV.\n– Estable para la durabilidad en climas ásperos.\n– Presentación en dos colores y variedad en sus diseños.\n– Fácil de limpiar y resistente a las manchas.\n– Reducción de ruido.\n\n– Seguridad antiderrapante.[/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=\"30px\"][vc_column_text]Sepa más sobre las excepcionales características de este <strong>material exclusivo para pisos náuticos</strong> basado en <strong>goma Eva</strong> utilizado en todo el mundo.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1609009380443{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-right: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !i